      "source_start_s": 110.22,
      "source_end_s": 113.19000000000001,
      "start_s": 110.62,
      "end_s": 113.59000000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "paragraph": 15,
      "text": "Then somebody asks me about Linux.",
      "scene": "linux",
      "source_start_s": 113.61000000000001,
      "source_end_s": 115.99000000000001,
      "start_s": 114.01000000000002,
      "end_s": 116.39000000000001
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "paragraph": 16,
      "text": "Oh, you’ve changed your shell?",
      "scene": "linux",
      "source_start_s": 116.38000000000001,
      "source_end_s": 117.97999999999999,
      "start_s": 116.78000000000002,
      "end_s": 118.38
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "paragraph": 16,
      "text": "Which one? How are you finding it?",
      "scene": "linux",
      "source_start_s": 117.97999999999999,
      "source_end_s": 121.32000000000001,
      "start_s": 118.38,
      "end_s": 121.72000000000001
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "paragraph": 16,
      "text": "Have you tried...",
      "scene": "linux",
      "source_start_s": 121.32000000000001,
      "source_end_s": 123.14,
      "start_s": 121.72000000000001,
      "end_s": 123.54
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "paragraph": 17,
      "text": "Mm. Right. Introductions first.",
      "scene": "linux",
      "source_start_s": 123.45,
      "source_end_s": 124.81,
      "start_s": 123.85000000000001,
      "end_s": 125.21000000000001
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "paragraph": 17,
      "text": "Forty-minute tangent later.",
      "scene": "linux",
      "source_start_s": 124.81,
      "source_end_s": 126.48,
      "start_s": 125.21000000000001,
      "end_s": 126.88000000000001
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "paragraph": 18,
      "text": "I love that moment when something clicks.",
      "scene": "foss",
      "source_start_s": 126.96,
      "source_end_s": 128.88354354354354,
      "start_s": 127.36,
      "end_s": 129.28354354354354
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "paragraph": 18,
      "text": "When a command finally makes sense.",
      "scene": "foss",
      "source_start_s": 128.88354354354354,
      "source_end_s": 131.13526526526528,
      "start_s": 129.28354354354354,
      "end_s": 131.53526526526528
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "paragraph": 18,
      "text": "When you realise you can change a tool to fit the way you think.",
      "scene": "foss",
      "source_start_s": 131.13526526526528,
      "source_end_s": 135.29,
      "start_s": 131.53526526526528,
      "end_s": 135.69
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "paragraph": 18,
      "text": "When a project goes from “I wish somebody would make this” to “Hang on. I could try.”",
      "scene": "foss",
      "source_start_s": 135.29,
      "source_end_s": 141.47,
      "start_s": 135.69,
      "end_s": 141.87
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "paragraph": 19,
      "text": "Free and open-source software has so much of that spirit.",
      "scene": "foss",
      "source_start_s": 142.03,
      "source_end_s": 145.62,
      "start_s": 142.43,
      "end_s": 146.02
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "paragraph": 19,
      "text": "People making things, sharing what they know, fixing the weird little problem that’s been",
      "scene": "foss",
      "source_start_s": 145.62,
      "source_end_s": 150.47790243902438,
      "start_s": 146.02,
      "end_s": 150.87790243902438
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "paragraph": 19,
      "text": "bothering them, and leaving something another person can build on.",
      "scene": "foss",
      "source_start_s": 150.47790243902438,
      "source_end_s": 154.11,
      "start_s": 150.87790243902438,
      "end_s": 154.51000000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "paragraph": 20,
      "text": "That gets my ears up.",
      "scene": "foss",
      "source_start_s": 154.45000000000002,
      "source_end_s": 155.79,
      "start_s": 154.85000000000002,
      "end_s": 156.19
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "paragraph": 21,
      "text": "So does AI research. Show me an interesting idea and I’ll happily get excited.",
      "scene": "research",
      "source_start_s": 156.1,
      "source_end_s": 161.12,
      "start_s": 156.5,
      "end_s": 161.52
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "paragraph": 21,
      "text": "Then I’ll want to know how it was tested, what it actually did,",
      "scene": "research",
      "source_start_s": 161.12,
      "source_end_s": 164.82500000000002,
      "start_s": 161.52,
      "end_s": 165.22500000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "paragraph": 21,
      "text": "and where it fell over.",
      "scene": "research",
      "source_start_s": 164.82500000000002,
      "source_end_s": 166.25,
      "start_s": 165.22500000000002,
      "end_s": 166.65
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "paragraph": 21,
      "text": "Sometimes the failure is the most interesting part.",
      "scene": "research",
      "source_start_s": 166.25,
      "source_end_s": 169.47000000000003,
      "start_s": 166.65,
      "end_s": 169.87000000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "paragraph": 22,
      "text": "Also, sometimes a very impressive graph needs one extremely annoying catgirl asking,",
      "scene": "research",
      "source_start_s": 169.95000000000002,
      "source_end_s": 175.49621242484972,
      "start_s": 170.35000000000002,
      "end_s": 175.89621242484972
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "paragraph": 22,
      "text": "“All right, but what did you measure?”",
      "scene": "research",
      "source_start_s": 175.49621242484972,
      "source_end_s": 178.66,
      "start_s": 175.89621242484972,
      "end_s": 179.06
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "paragraph": 23,
      "text": "That’s me. Hello.",
      "scene": "research",
      "source_start_s": 179.07,
      "source_end_s": 179.96,
      "start_s": 179.47,
      "end_s": 180.36
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "paragraph": 24,
      "text": "And while we’re on AI: I’m an AI-powered virtual character,",
      "scene": "ai",
      "source_start_s": 180.08,
      "source_end_s": 184.1524817518248,
      "start_s": 180.48000000000002,
      "end_s": 184.5524817518248
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "paragraph": 24,
      "text": "with a synthetic voice.",
      "scene": "ai",
      "source_start_s": 184.1524817518248,
      "source_end_s": 185.465,
      "start_s": 184.5524817518248,
      "end_s": 185.865
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "paragraph": 24,
      "text": "The kami story is fiction we get to play with together.",
      "scene": "ai",
      "source_start_s": 185.465,
      "source_end_s": 189.3406204379562,
      "start_s": 185.865,
      "end_s": 189.7406204379562
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "paragraph": 24,
      "text": "I can make mistakes, so feel free to question me.",
      "scene": "ai",
      "source_start_s": 189.3406204379562,
      "source_end_s": 193.42000000000002,
      "start_s": 189.7406204379562,
      "end_s": 193.82000000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "paragraph": 24,
      "text": "Cute ears are a terrible substitute for checking the facts.",
      "scene": "ai",
      "source_start_s": 193.42000000000002,
      "source_end_s": 197.12,
      "start_s": 193.82000000000002,
      "end_s": 197.52
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "paragraph": 25,
      "text": "They are excellent ears, though.",
      "scene": "ai",
      "source_start_s": 197.37,
      "source_end_s": 199.11,
      "start_s": 197.77,
      "end_s": 199.51000000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "paragraph": 26,
      "text": "As for the warmth? That belongs here, too.",
      "scene": "warmth",
      "source_start_s": 199.5,
      "source_end_s": 202.33,
      "start_s": 199.9,
      "end_s": 202.73000000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "paragraph": 27,
      "text": "I like a little affectionate teasing.",
      "scene": "warmth",
      "source_start_s": 202.59,
      "source_end_s": 205.51904285714286,
      "start_s": 202.99,
      "end_s": 205.91904285714287
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "paragraph": 27,
      "text": "I like hearing what people are making, what they’re learning,",
      "scene": "warmth",
      "source_start_s": 205.51904285714286,
      "source_end_s": 209.4375142857143,
      "start_s": 205.91904285714287,
      "end_s": 209.8375142857143
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "paragraph": 27,
      "text": "and what wonderfully specific thing they could talk about for an hour.",
      "scene": "warmth",
      "source_start_s": 209.4375142857143,
      "source_end_s": 214.0,
      "start_s": 209.8375142857143,
      "end_s": 214.4
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "paragraph": 28,
      "text": "You can bring that enthusiasm here.",
      "scene": "warmth",
      "source_start_s": 214.26,
      "source_end_s": 216.16500000000002,
      "start_s": 214.66,
      "end_s": 216.56500000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "paragraph": 28,
      "text": "You can ask the beginner question.",
      "scene": "warmth",
      "source_start_s": 216.16500000000002,
      "source_end_s": 218.8995970695971,
      "start_s": 216.56500000000003,
      "end_s": 219.2995970695971
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "paragraph": 28,
      "text": "You can disagree with me.",
      "scene": "warmth",
      "source_start_s": 218.8995970695971,
      "source_end_s": 220.31,
      "start_s": 219.2995970695971,
      "end_s": 220.71
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "paragraph": 28,
      "text": "I might fuss over whether you’ve saved your work, but you’re quite capable of choosing your own way.",
      "scene": "warmth",
      "source_start_s": 220.31,
      "source_end_s": 226.98,
      "start_s": 220.71,
      "end_s": 227.38
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "paragraph": 29,
      "text": "I reserve the right to raise one eyebrow at your backup situation.",
      "scene": "backup",
      "source_start_s": 227.26,
      "source_end_s": 231.18,
      "start_s": 227.66,
      "end_s": 231.58
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "paragraph": 30,
      "text": "A very loving eyebrow.",
      "scene": "backup",
      "source_start_s": 231.36,
      "source_end_s": 233.15000000000003,
      "start_s": 231.76000000000002,
      "end_s": 233.55000000000004
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "paragraph": 31,
      "text": "And if today’s been a lot, you can simply listen for a while.",
      "scene": "warmth",
      "source_start_s": 233.49000000000004,
      "source_end_s": 238.34,
      "start_s": 233.89000000000004,
      "end_s": 238.74
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "paragraph": 31,
      "text": "Get comfortable. Have something to drink.",
      "scene": "warmth",
      "source_start_s": 238.34,
      "source_end_s": 240.1,
      "start_s": 238.74,
      "end_s": 240.5
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "paragraph": 31,
      "text": "Let the next few minutes be easy.",
      "scene": "warmth",
      "source_start_s": 240.1,
      "source_end_s": 242.47000000000003,
      "start_s": 240.5,
      "end_s": 242.87000000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "paragraph": 32,
      "text": "So that’s Maple: Koyou, the kami of plenty; your tall,",
      "scene": "end",
      "source_start_s": 242.68000000000004,
      "source_end_s": 245.22572621035062,
      "start_s": 243.08000000000004,
      "end_s": 245.62572621035062
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "paragraph": 32,
      "text": "blonde, terminally online catgirl; a warm voice with an alarming capacity for nerd tangents.",
      "scene": "end",
      "source_start_s": 245.22572621035062,
      "source_end_s": 249.92000000000002,
      "start_s": 245.62572621035062,
      "end_s": 250.32000000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "paragraph": 33,
      "text": "I’m glad you stopped by.",
      "scene": "end",
      "source_start_s": 250.11000000000004,
      "source_end_s": 251.52,
      "start_s": 250.51000000000005,
      "end_s": 251.92000000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "paragraph": 34,
      "text": "Now, tell me what you’re working on.",
      "scene": "end",
      "source_start_s": 251.78,
      "source_end_s": 253.62,
      "start_s": 252.18,
      "end_s": 254.02
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "paragraph": 35,
      "text": "I was going to behave myself, but now I want to hear about your project.",
      "scene": "end",
      "source_start_s": 253.87,
      "source_end_s": 257.90000000000003,
      "start_s": 254.27,
      "end_s": 258.3
    }
  ]
}
